  "bio": "Son of the Companion Abu Musa and judge in Kufa, known by his kunya; his given name is disputed between Amir and al-Harith. He narrated from his father and from senior Companions, and his sons Sa'id and Bilal and his grandson Burayd carried his hadith. In hadith 2996 it is his remark to a fasting travelling-companion that brings out his father's report.",
